{"articleNo":"652","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=652&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 1학기 학기제현장실습 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.06","hit":"16054","attachments":[{"name":"학기제현장실습서식.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=652&attachNo=69371"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 16pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2009학년도 1학기 학기제현장실습 신청 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">1. 이수대상 : 3학년 이상 재학생(재학중 1회에 한함.)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">2. 이수시기 : 해당 학기 내 실시</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">3. 이수기간 : 15주 이상(법정근로시간)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">4. 이수신청 : “학기제현장실습신청서”를 작성하여 해당 학부(과)에 제출</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞첨부파일 참고</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">5. 신청기간 : 2009. 2. 16(월) ~ 2. 20(금)까지 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">6. 대상업체(해당 학부 종합학사행정실 문의)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">가. 학부장이 추천하는 전공과 관련이 있는 업체</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 학부장이 추천하는 업체 이외에 학생이 선정하는 전공과 관련이 있는 업체</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">7. 수강신청</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">가. 주간수업은 신청할 수 없음</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">나. 실습기관이 출퇴근 거리를 벗어난 경우 등은 수강신청할 수 없음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">다. 실습대상자로 허가된 학생은 교무연구과에서 일괄 수강신청.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -52.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ☞ 주간수업을 수강신청했을 경우 수강신청 확인 및 변경기간[2009. 3. 4(수) ~ </span><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">3. 6</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -52.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (금)]에 “수강과목 변경 신청서”를 작성하여 해당 종합학사행정실에 주간수업 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 52.2pt; TEXT-INDENT: -52.2pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.2pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 삭제요청을 하여야 함. 미삭제 시 학기제현장실습 불허.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 75.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -75.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">8. 성적처리 : 현장실습 합격자는 S, 불합격자는 U로 평가되며, U로 평가받은 성적은 기록</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 75.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -75.7pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 하지 않음.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 81pt; TEXT-INDENT: -81pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">9. 문의전화</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '굴림'\">&nbsp;각 학부(과) 종합학사행정실 전화번호</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"102\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">행정실 명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 0.4pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"321\" bgcolor=\"#ffffcc\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"23\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 9pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '굴림체'\">학부(과)명</span></p>\n            </td>\n            <td st